<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 3/4.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 3/4.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Thursday set the following currency fixings for July 4. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   04.07.97	  03.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6980	    6.6326</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2808	    2.2913</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4882	    4.5006</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4996	    3.4925</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5143	    0.5159</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7656	    0.7687</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2866	    0.2866</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9838	    6.9906</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6910	    0.6917</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2148	    1.2188</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
